# phase3 verification — raw literal log

Scope: session history page, leaderboard UI + rules, notes tags/favorites/
search, couverture-par-module ranking. Past-exam/period untouched this round.
No prose verdicts below — command + literal output only.

Code footprint:
  src/routes/sessions.routes.ts         (+GET /api/sessions history list)
  src/routes/notes.routes.ts            (+q/tag/favoritesOnly, +tags/isFavorite
                                         on create, +PATCH /:id, NOTE_TAGS)
  src/routes/questions.routes.ts        (+GET /questions/coverage)
  prisma/schema.prisma                  (+Note.tags TEXT[] default [], +Note.isFavorite)
  prisma/migrations/20260101000020_add_note_tags_favorite/migration.sql (new)
  web/src/lib/types.ts                  (+SessionHistoryEntry/Unit, +LeaderboardEntry,
                                         +Note.tags/isFavorite)
  web/src/lib/nav.ts                    (+Historique/Classement/Couverture)
  web/src/app/historique/page.tsx       (new)
  web/src/app/classement/page.tsx       (new, rules Modal)
  web/src/app/couverture/page.tsx       (new, honest "bank coverage" copy)
  web/src/app/notes/page.tsx            (search/tag pills/favorites/tag editor)

Screenshots (live localhost:3001 DOM):
  docs/verification/phase3-history.png    (grouped sessions, Continuer/Revoir)
