  docs/verification/phase3-notes-tags.png (tag pills, star, editor result)

STATEMENTS (design facts the raw output below proves):
- History needed a new READ endpoint, not schema: no list route existed
  (routes were create/detail/answers/hints/submit/results only). No columns
  added anywhere for this item.
- Cohort scoping is real, not global: pairs derive from User.groupBy
  (faculty/year), snapshots store facultyId/yearId per pair (SQL proof in
  section 2), the endpoint requires both params. Cohort = users' profile
  faculty/year at generation (sessions carry none) — the rules panel says
  exactly this.
- Ranking metric honesty: endpoint counts APPROVED QUESTIONS per module
  (bank coverage). UI titled "Couverture par module" with subtitle
  disclaiming exam frequency. MedSparkDZ's name/semantic NOT borrowed.

